# AutoPulse core

- Two services: `services/enrichment` (Mongo + LLM/CV) and `services/pricer`
  (MySQL + margin rules), talking over RabbitMQ topic exchange.
- Shared contracts live in `shared/autopulse_shared/schemas/`.
- Ack enrichment only after LLM + CV + durable Mongo upsert.
- Offload blocking CV/SDK work with `asyncio.to_thread`.
- Follow `docs/roadmap.md`; extend `TODO(week-N)` stubs instead of parallel code.
- English in code; max line length 100; SOLID layering (api → services → repos).
